+# Phase 1 ΓÇö Foundation Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Build the secure multi-tenant foundation for the Tabulation SaaS ΓÇö Google OAuth, organizations, data-driven RBAC, entitlement hooks, core schema, design system, and a working app shell you can onboard a real org into.
+
+**Architecture:** Better-Auth runs on Convex via the `@convex-dev/better-auth` component (auth tables in our deployment); the app owns a `userProfiles` table keyed by `tokenIdentifier`. Every tenant-scoped table carries an indexed `orgId`; every public Convex function begins with a `require*` helper that returns a typed `AuthCtx`. Routes are URL-embedded `/app/[orgSlug]/...`.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Next.js 16.3, React 19, Convex ^1.43, TypeScript (strict), Tailwind v4, `better-auth` + `@convex-dev/better-auth`, shadcn/ui, lucide-react, `convex-test` + `vitest` + `@edge-runtime/vm`.
+
+**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-12-phase1-foundation-design.md` ΓÇö read it before starting.
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- **OS:** Windows; PowerShell 5.1. Use PowerShell syntax, not bash. Use `;` and `if ($?) { }` ΓÇö never `&&`.
+- **Convex:** object-form function syntax (`{ args, handler }`), validators on every function, no `userId` as an auth arg, no `Date.now()` in queries, no unbounded arrays in docs, no `v.any()`.
+- **Schema:** `convex/schema.ts`; index names list all fields (`by_org_id_and_user_id`).
+- **Auth:** Better-Auth via local `convex/betterAuth/` component; `ctx.auth.getUserIdentity().tokenIdentifier` is the stable key.
+- **RBAC:** single `roleId` per membership; permission set built from `rolePermissions` + `permissions` join.
+- **TDD:** every lib helper and mutation gets a failing `convex-test` test first, then implementation.
+- **Commits:** one commit per task; conventional-commit messages (`feat:`, `chore:`, `test:`, `refactor:`).
+- **No emojis in code or UI.** No code comments unless explicitly requested.
+- **Verify after every task:** `npm run typecheck` must pass before a task is considered done.
+
+---
+
